    "name": "AarogyamCareAI - Local API Test Suite",
    "description": "Local-only API tests derived from backend/node-api/src/server.ts and backend/ml-backend/app.py. Configure credentials in a local Postman environment; never export secrets. Run with npm run dev:test for deterministic Chat and Report Analysis requests. The SMS-send endpoint is intentionally excluded.",
